        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86437-86184, Baden Pull with 12 x 3 Modern Pull Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Baden Door Pull with Modern Pull Plate was made to grace Fifth Avenue; but even if you don't live in the big apple, this modern pull plate is perfect to bring New York City glamour to any home. It is available in a wide selection of contemporary finishes. The Baden Pull is 8-5/8 long and the pull plate is 12 inches by 3 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching <a href=\"/products/12-x-3-modern-push-plate-emtek-86436\"><b>Modern Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Emtek Modern Pull Plate with Baden Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Total Length: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mount Base: 1\" x 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with (1) door pull, (1) pull plate, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86437-86184-spcifications.pdf?v=1704262359\"><b>Emtek 86437-86184 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern7-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354499\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
